# /unit — PHPUnit (API-only)

**Không** nằm team workflow diagram · **không** portal testcase YAML · **không** qua router `/api`.

Skill: `.cursor/skills/unit/SKILL.md` · Grill: `.cursor/skills/grill-unit/SKILL.md`  
Extract: `.cursor/extracts/unit-coverage.md`, `.cursor/extracts/api-unit-test-tags.md`, `verify-gate.md`

Manifest-first sau `api:gen` (auto `api:unit-gen` khi profile có `#gen:test-unit`):

Diagram: [`docs/operational/UNIT-PHASE-DIAGRAM.md`](../../docs/operational/UNIT-PHASE-DIAGRAM.md) — unit lane + tag lifecycle (2 diagram).

```bash
pnpm api:gen --spec docs/features/{slug}/01-backend-spec.yaml
# hoặc tay: pnpm api:unit-gen --spec ...
# read generated/unit.manifest.json → needsUnit[] should be []
cd src && php artisan test --testsuite=Module{Module}
```

`/unit` = **verify-only** tại base phase — không hand-write behavioral cho `needsUnit`.

**Stub dedupe:** `api:unit-gen` (phase `all`) không chạy lại `m:module-test` nếu `api:gen`/wizard đã sinh stub — xem `skippedPatterns` trong `unit.manifest.json`. Refresh stub: `--phase stub --force`.
